E AX3027 builder.ax:- declaration-macro "a generated declaration's name must be a bare identifier; `N` was given an expression" !"the parameter stands in a NAME position of the template - a declaration head or a parameter list - and only an identifier can be a name" ?"pass a plain name in this argument position"
E AX3021 builder.ax:- macro-template-unsupported "a declaration template may generate `fn`, `::`, `data`, `struct`, `type` and `effect` declarations, or further macro invocations - this form is not supported yet" !"trait, import and nested macro templates are refusals rather than silent passthroughs, so the commit that adds one adds it loudly (MAC-CAP-2)" ?"generate the declaration by hand, or extend the template surface"
E AX3034 builder.ax:- macro-ellipsis "`...` follows nothing that repeats" !"a template MUST use a repeated binding under an ellipsis of the same depth (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16): a name bound to a SEQUENCE is many forms, and every position that takes one form needs to be told which" ?"repetition lives in a rule-form macro's match: move the match there, or drop the marker"
E AX3034 builder.ax:- macro-ellipsis "`...` follows nothing that repeats" !"a template MUST use a repeated binding under an ellipsis of the same depth (macro-system.md MAC-LANG-16): a name bound to a SEQUENCE is many forms, and every position that takes one form needs to be told which" ?"put `...` directly after a constructor form whose names repeat, or drop it"
E AX3024 builder.ax:- macro-expansion-limit "macro expansion produced more than the limit of 10000 declarations" !"the parser's own nesting limit measures the SOURCE, and this limit measures what expansion produced from it" ?"expansion is a rewrite, so the program the compiler sees is the expanded one; make the macro produce less, or write the repeated part as a function and let the macro expand to a call"
